WEBVTT

00:12:28.952 --> 00:12:31.163
and its unintended consequences.

00:12:31.789 --> 00:12:33.415
The big lesson here

00:12:33.457 --> 00:12:38.670
is that we can't afford to just shift
to a different set of energies,

00:12:38.712 --> 00:12:40.088
technologies and materials

00:12:40.130 --> 00:12:43.592
without paying attention
to the unintended consequences.

00:12:45.135 --> 00:12:46.845
The stakes are too high.

00:12:47.596 --> 00:12:49.348
They involve our future.

00:12:49.389 --> 00:12:50.557
That we know.

00:12:51.266 --> 00:12:53.685
But they also involve our humanity.

00:12:54.978 --> 00:12:57.564
And they involve our nature,

00:12:57.564 --> 00:13:01.151
by which I mean the nature
that we choose for ourselves.